title: "Nullius in Onion"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool to triage lists of .onion and clearnet services: is it up,
  who already lists it, and what changed since last time — one plain request per
  target over Tor, with the reasons and the caveats, keeping nothing that
  describes the page.
